+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- A turn with no tool calls reports the provider's usage directly ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
+- A turn driven through two tool rounds reports usage summed across every provider call in that turn ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L16)).
+- Rounds reporting no usage are omitted from the sum without producing undefined or NaN, and a turn where no round reported usage reports undefined ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when one round reports none, and reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L47)).
+
